<title>SPAIN: SPAIN AER LINGUS UNIT CALLS AUGUST STRIKE.</title>
<headline>SPAIN AER LINGUS UNIT CALLS AUGUST STRIKE.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish airline pilot union SEPLA said on Friday it has called a strike from August 15 to 24 affecting pilots at charter airline Hispano-Irlandesa de Aviacion (Futura), a unit of Aer Lingus.</p>
<p>In a statement, SEPLA said the action would affect pilots at Palma de Mallorca, Tenerife and Las Palmas airports.</p>
<p>The union said the strike had been called because Futura has not complied with the terms of its contract.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
